      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"AnnotationDetectionFieldCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>AnnotationDetectionFieldCallback</code></a> scanning for an annotation of the given type.",
      "translation": "创建一个用于扫描给定类型注解的新的<a href=\"AnnotationDetectionFieldCallback.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的类\"><code>AnnotationDetectionFieldCallback</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the field or throws an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a> if no field could be found.",
      "translation": "返回该字段的类型，如果找不到任何字段，则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the detected field.",
      "translation": "返回检测到的字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the field that was detected.",
      "translation": "返回检测到的字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
